---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import heroPizza from '../assets/hero-pizza5.png';
import { whatsappUrl } from '../lib/whatsapp';
---

<section id="inicio" class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream">
	<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-6 py-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:px-10 lg:py-8">
		<div>
			<p class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 font-script text-2xl text-forest">
				Estilo Chicago
				<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"/><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"/></svg>
			</p>
			<h1 class="font-display text-5xl font-black leading-[1.05] sm:text-6xl">
				PIZZA VERDADERA.<br />
				<span class="text-primary">PASIÓN ETERNA.</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-ink/70">
				Elaborada con ingredientes frescos, masa estirada a mano y horneada a la perfección en horno de leña. Prueba la tradición en cada bocado.
			</p>
			<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
				<a href="#menu" class="rounded-md bg-primary px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-cream shadow-md hover:bg-primary-dark transition-colors">
					VER MENÚ
				</a>
				<a href={whatsappUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-md border-2 border-ink px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-ink hover:bg-ink hover:text-cream transition-colors">
					ORDENAR X WHATSAPP
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="relative">
			<div class="relative aspect-[4/4] w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-ink shadow-2xl">
				<Image
					src={heroPizza}
					alt="Porción de pizza con queso derretido, pepperoni y vegetales, recién horneada"
					class="h-full w-full object-cover object-[65%_45%]"
					width={1200}
					height={900}
					loading="eager"
				/>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
